# apps/web — environment template.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY and BIDINTEL_API_URL now live in the canonical repo-root
# .env.example and are loaded automatically by apps/web/next.config.ts (dotenv, pointed at
# ../../.env) -- you do NOT need a copy of this file for a normal setup.
#
# This file is only for a PER-MACHINE OVERRIDE: copy to .env.local (gitignored; Next.js loads
# it automatically and it takes precedence over the root .env) if this machine needs a
# different value than the shared one -- e.g. a teammate using their own, differently
# HTTP-referrer-restricted Maps key. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §9 for what the Maps key does.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Backend URL override (default http://127.0.0.1:8010 — see apps/web/src/app/api/*/route.ts)
# BIDINTEL_API_URL=
